<===> README.md
Like dart-sass (1.101.4), legacy colors with non-integer channels are written
with percentages. Compressed output uses the shorter one of rgb() and hsl().
<===>
================================================================================
<===> decimal/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> decimal/input.scss
a {
  b: rgb(0 255 127.5);
  c: rgba(0, 255, 127.5, .5);
  d: rgb(10.25 20.5 30.125);
  e: rgb(255 0 0.5);
}
<===> decimal/output.css
a{b:rgb(0%,100%,50%);c:rgba(0%,100%,50%,.5);d:rgb(4.0196078431%,8.0392156863%,11.8137254902%);e:rgb(100%,0%,.1960784314%)}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> integer/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> integer/input.scss
a {
  b: rgb(1 2 3);
  c: rgba(1, 2, 3, .5);
}
<===> integer/output.css
a{b:#010203;c:rgba(1,2,3,.5)}
<===>
================================================================================
<===> shorter_hsl/options.yml
:output_style: compressed

<===> shorter_hsl/input.scss
a {b: rgb(1.5 2 3)}
<===> shorter_hsl/output.css
a{b:hsl(220,33.3333333333%,.8823529412%)}
